{"seq":1,"slug":"sharding-key-selection-hotspot-avoidance","title":"分片键选择、倾斜检测与热点规避","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/sharding-strategy-routing-model/sharding-key-selection-hotspot-avoidance","wordCount":2612,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"分片键选择-倾斜检测与热点规避\">分片键选择、倾斜检测与热点规避</h1><p>一个跨境电商平台把订单表从单库撑到八个分片，做法是 <code>order_id % 8</code>。上线第一周平稳，第二周全站告警：八个分片里有一个 CPU 长期贴顶，其余七个空闲。原因是订单 ID 由分片前的序列生成器连续发放，取模之后同一段时间内新订单全落进同一个分片——技术上是「分片了」，物理上写流量还是排成一队。<strong>分片把容量问题变成了分布问题，而分布问题几乎总是由分片键的选择决定。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分片键的四条判据\">核心概念：分片键的四条判据</h2><p>选分片键不是找一个「唯一的、看起来均匀的」列，而是同时满足四个条件的取舍。先澄清一个易混淆点：「分片键」实际承担三件职责——<strong>决定落点</strong>（某行归属哪个物理分片，由且仅由一个键决定）、<strong>提供路由</strong>（查询 WHERE 能否收敛到少数分片，可由多个键提供，包括 lookup 二级键）、<strong>保证唯一</strong>（主键约束不跨分片校验）。三者可由同一个键承担，也可拆开，但「决定落点」的键有且只有一个，这是后面所有讨论的基础。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>不达标的后果</th>\n<th>典型反例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>基数（Cardinality）</strong></td>\n<td>不同取值的个数上限</td>\n<td>分片数被封顶，无法再扩</td>\n<td>按 <code>status</code> 分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>均匀度（Distribution）</strong></td>\n<td>取值出现频率的方差</td>\n<td>数据与负载集中到少数分片</td>\n<td>按 <code>continent</code>（欧洲占七成）分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>单调性（Monotonicity）</strong></td>\n<td>值是否只增不减</td>\n<td>新写入永远落在边界分片</td>\n<td>自增 <code>order_id</code>、<code>created_at</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>查询覆盖率（Query Coverage）</strong></td>\n<td>常用查询的 WHERE 是否带该列</td>\n<td>退化为广播（scatter-gather）</td>\n<td>按 <code>user_id</code> 分片却按 <code>order_no</code> 查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前三条决定写入能不能摊开，第四条决定读取能不能收敛。MongoDB 官方文档把它写成一句话：选一个<strong>高基数、分布均匀、非单调、且覆盖常见查询</strong>的分片键；并指出分片键的取值决定了 balancer 最多能切出多少 chunk——每个取值只能存在于一个 chunk 里，所以 <code>continent</code> 这种基数为 7 的列最多只能有意义地分到 7 个分片（<a href=\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/sharding-choose-a-shard-key/\">MongoDB Manual · Choose a Shard Key</a>）。Citus 的表述更直接：<strong>「Choose a column with high cardinality as the distribution column」</strong>，同时要求 <strong>even distribution</strong>——取值有偏时「data in the table will tend to accumulate in certain shards」，承载超大分片的节点承担不成比例的负载（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/sharding/data_modeling.html\">Citus · Data Modeling</a>）。电商特有的陷阱是：订单表分片键若选 <code>seller_id</code>，头部大卖家会天然压满一个分片；选 <code>buyer_id</code> 则长尾均匀得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单调键的三种消解手段\">单调键的三种消解手段</h2><p>自增主键是最自然、也是最糟糕的分片键：基数高、绝对均匀，但严格单调。设分片函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，keyrange 由小到大排列，则全部新写入命中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 边界分片：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>shard</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(k) \\to \\text{shard}_{\\max}, \\quad k_1 &lt; k_2 &lt; \\cdots &lt; k_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shard</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>按侵入性从低到高，有三种成熟解法。</p>\n<p><strong>让 ID 本身不再单调。</strong> TiDB 的 <code>AUTO_RANDOM(S, R)</code> 在 ID 高位插入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个随机分片位，把连续分配拆散到多个 Region。位布局是 1 个符号位 + <code>64-R</code> 个保留位 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片位 + <code>R-1-S</code> 个自增位，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R-1-S \\ge 27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span>；分片位取自当前事务起始时间的哈希，不同事务的写入落到不同高位区间（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/auto-random/\">TiDB</a>）。官方选值公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\lceil \\log_2 x \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 为存储节点数——16 个 TiKV 节点对应 4 个分片位。这等于把「单调」从主键上摘掉：ID 仍全局唯一，但对路由函数而言它近似随机。</p>\n<p><strong>不动主键，改隐式行 ID。</strong> 表无主键或使用非聚簇主键时，TiDB 用隐式的 <code>_tidb_rowid</code>，默认 <code>SHARD_ROW_ID_BITS = 0</code>（1 个分片），写入必然集中；设为 4 表示 16 个分片、设为 6 表示 64 个分片，取值同样是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的经验法则（<a href=\"https://docs.pingcap.com/tidb/stable/shard-row-id-bits/\">TiDB</a>）。代价是分片位吃掉自增位空间：<code>_tidb_rowid</code> 上限仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{63}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，位耗尽时报 <code>Failed to read auto-increment value from storage engine</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>改用哈希分片或改 ID 生成。</strong> 若单调键必须保留（例如监管要求订单号连续可审计），就让分片函数本身做哈希——MongoDB 建议分片键单调时使用 Hashed Sharding，把写入摊到多个 chunk 而非压在 <code>MaxKey</code>/<code>MinKey</code> 边界（<a href=\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/sharding-choose-a-shard-key/\">MongoDB</a>）；代价是范围查询丢失局部性，<code>WHERE order_no BETWEEN a AND b</code> 变成全分片广播。中间件层常改 ID 生成：MySQL 多主复制用 <code>auto_increment_increment</code> 与 <code>auto_increment_offset</code> 让各分片产出互不重叠的序列（三节点设 increment=3、offset 1/2/3 得 1,4,7… / 2,5,8… / 3,6,9…），未来可能加节点时应预留更大的公共 increment（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/replication-options-source.html\">MySQL 8.4</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;待选分片键&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否单调(自增 ID / 时间戳)&quot;}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C{&quot;能否改动 ID 生成&lt;br/&gt;或分片函数&quot;}&#10;    C -- 能 --&gt; D[&quot;AUTO_RANDOM / SHARD_ROW_ID_BITS / 哈希分片&quot;]&#10;    C -- 不能 --&gt; E[&quot;复合键高位打散&quot;]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; F{&quot;基数 ≥ 目标分片数 10 倍？&quot;}&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; G[&quot;加列提升基数&quot;]&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; H{&quot;取值分布是否均匀&quot;}&#10;    H -- 否 --&gt; I[&quot;拆维度或加 lookup 路由&quot;]&#10;    H -- 是 --&gt; J{&quot;常用查询是否带该列&quot;}&#10;    J -- 否 --&gt; K[&quot;加 lookup vindex&quot;]&#10;    J -- 是 --&gt; L[&quot;接受该键,进入倾斜检测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"待选分片键\"] --&gt; B{\"是否单调(自增 ID / 时间戳)\"}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C{\"能否改动 ID 生成&lt;br/&gt;或分片函数\"}\n    C -- 能 --&gt; D[\"AUTO_RANDOM / SHARD_ROW_ID_BITS / 哈希分片\"]\n    C -- 不能 --&gt; E[\"复合键高位打散\"]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; F{\"基数 ≥ 目标分片数 10 倍？\"}\n    F -- 否 --&gt; G[\"加列提升基数\"]\n    F -- 是 --&gt; H{\"取值分布是否均匀\"}\n    H -- 否 --&gt; I[\"拆维度或加 lookup 路由\"]\n    H -- 是 --&gt; J{\"常用查询是否带该列\"}\n    J -- 否 --&gt; K[\"加 lookup vindex\"]\n    J -- 是 --&gt; L[\"接受该键,进入倾斜检测\"]</pre><h2 id=\"路由模型-分片键到物理分片的映射\">路由模型：分片键到物理分片的映射</h2><p>分片键选定之后，还需要一层显式路由模型把「键值」翻译成「分片」。Vitess 把每一层都命名清楚：<strong>Primary Vindex</strong> 由分片键算出 <strong>keyspace ID</strong>（左侧对齐的二进制串），每个分片持有一段连续、左闭右开的 <strong>keyrange</strong>，分片名即范围的十六进制表示——<code>80-c0</code> 表示 <code>[0x80, 0xc0)</code>，四等分是 <code>-40</code>、<code>40-80</code>、<code>80-c0</code>、<code>c0-</code>；不变量是必须有且仅有一个分片以空集开头、一个以空集结尾（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/22.0/reference/features/sharding/\">Vitess · Sharding</a>）。可切割性来自 keyspace ID 的连续性而非分片键的表面形态，Vitess 允许不等分切分（如 <code>c0-dc00</code>），正是把热点范围切细的空间。</p>\n<p>真正让分片键工程复杂的是<strong>二级查询列</strong>。电商订单天然按 <code>user_id</code> 分片，但运营侧大量按 <code>order_no</code> 或 <code>seller_id</code> 查。Vitess 用 <strong>lookup vindex</strong> 解决：一张后备表把 <code>order_no</code> 映射到 keyspace ID，插入时写入、查询时先查表再定向。成本被量化在路由成本表里——Identity 0、Functional 1、Lookup Unique 10、Lookup NonUnique 20，VTGate 选当下可用的最低成本 vindex（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/22.0/reference/features/vindexes/\">Vitess</a>）。lookup vindex 是 NonUnique，不能作为 Primary Vindex——它只提供路由，不决定落点。<strong>决定落点的键只能有一个，路由键可以有很多。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"倾斜检测-把-感觉不均-变成可量化的指标\">倾斜检测：把「感觉不均」变成可量化的指标</h2><p>热点治理的第一步是能证明它存在。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片、总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、期望值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i = M/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、观测值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，均匀性由卡方统计量度量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\frac{(o_i - e_i)^2}{e_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p> 完全均匀时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，但工程上更有用的是<strong>最热分片比值</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(o_i)/e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：它直接对应扩容语言——长期大于 2 意味着你要按两倍容量部署才能抵御最坏分片，等于一半硬件在为倾斜买单。工业界已把该度量做进产品：MongoDB 7.0 的 Shard Key Analyzer 先开启查询采样，再对候选键执行 <code>analyzeShardKey</code>，返回的 <code>keyCharacteristics</code> 直接给出 cardinality、frequency、monotonicity 三个指标，<code>readWriteDistribution</code> 给出跨 shard-key 范围的查询路由与负载分布（<a href=\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/sharding-choose-a-shard-key/\">MongoDB Manual</a>）；TiDB 侧对应 Dashboard 的 Key Visualizer 热力图。</p>\n<p>检测的时机比工具更容易被忽略。倾斜往往不是由日常流量暴露的，而是由<strong>大促</strong>暴露的：平时写入方差可能只有 1.2 倍，大促时爆款 SKU、头部卖家、单一市场专场会把某几个分片推到 5 倍以上。所以倾斜基线要在低峰期采集，容量规划必须按大促峰值的最热分片来算。Citus 把这一点归结为一句话：分片键选错，代价不是「慢一点」，而是<strong>某些节点承担了不成比例的工作，成为瓶颈</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.citusdata.com/en/stable/sharding/data_modeling.html\">Citus</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电商场景下的复合键设计\">电商场景下的复合键设计</h2><p>把四条判据放到真实表结构上，最常用的解法是复合分片键——低基数但决定落点的列做高位，高基数且单调的列做低位。以订单表为例：<code>(seller_id, order_id)</code> 作为复合键，路由只取 <code>seller_id</code>，<code>order_id</code> 仅参与唯一性。这解决了单调性问题（落点不再随 order_id 增长而漂移），但没解决头部卖家的天然倾斜——占平台 GMV 三成的大卖家仍压满一个分片。需叠加第二层手段：把大卖家的订单切到更细的 keyrange，或做二次哈希（<code>hash(seller_id + order_id) % n</code>）；后者会让卖家维度的范围查询退化为广播，是一笔明账。</p>\n<p>参照表是同一问题的另一面。Citus 把「无法与小表共置的跨租户维度表」做成 <strong>reference table</strong> 复制到所有 worker——税率表、汇率表、承运商表在电商里都属于这类；它们读远多于写、体量小、几乎每个查询都要 join，复制到全节点的成本远低于跨分片 join。<strong>能共置的共置，不能共置的复制，两者都不行的才走跨片查询。</strong> 而扩展性并不免费：Vitess 的 VReplication 在线再平衡报告的吞吐是「相比传统 MySQL 复制有 3–20 倍提升」，但再平衡本身要经历全量拷贝加持续 binlog 追平，切流阶段还有数秒只读窗口（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/22.0/reference/vreplication/vreplication/\">Vitess</a>）。分片键选错的成本不止是当下的热点，还包括未来一次昂贵且需要停写的迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分片键的选择决定了分片方案的上限，而它之后的每一步都是对这一选择的执行与补救。几条结论可以带走：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>落点键唯一、路由键可多</strong>——决定行归属的键只有一个，<code>order_no</code>、<code>seller_id</code> 这类二级查询列通过 lookup 提供路由，不参与落点。</li>\n<li><strong>单调性是第一大敌</strong>——自增 ID 与时间戳必然把新写入压到边界分片，消解手段依次是隐式行 ID 打散（<code>SHARD_ROW_ID_BITS</code>）、ID 随机化（<code>AUTO_RANDOM</code>）、哈希分片或改 ID 生成。</li>\n<li><strong>倾斜要量化后才谈治理</strong>——用最热分片比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(o_i)/e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与卡方统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取代「感觉不均」；基线在低峰期采集，容量按大促峰值最热分片规划。</li>\n<li><strong>参考数据不参与分片</strong>——税率、汇率、承运商这类小而读多的表做成 reference table 全节点复制，比跨片 join 便宜。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>键选对之后，下一个问题是「路由怎么落到具体分片」——SQL 解析层如何判断一条语句该去哪些分片、hint 如何强制路由，见 <a href=\"routing-layer-sql-parser-hint\">路由层：SQL 解析与 Hint 机制</a>。当分片数需要继续增长、或历史数据已倾斜而不得不重新切分时，问题就从选键转向了 <a href=\"../rebalancing-consistent-hashing-online-migration/consistent-hashing-virtual-node-partition\">一致性哈希与虚拟节点分区</a> 所讨论的再平衡机制；而在键与容量都已确定的稳态下，<a href=\"shard-mapping-capacity-planning\">分片映射与容量规划</a> 处理如何把现有数据映射到目标分片数并预留扩展空间。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分片键选择、倾斜检测与热点规避","id":"分片键选择-倾斜检测与热点规避"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分片键的四条判据","id":"核心概念-分片键的四条判据"},{"level":2,"text":"单调键的三种消解手段","id":"单调键的三种消解手段"},{"level":2,"text":"路由模型：分片键到物理分片的映射","id":"路由模型-分片键到物理分片的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"倾斜检测：把「感觉不均」变成可量化的指标","id":"倾斜检测-把-感觉不均-变成可量化的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"电商场景下的复合键设计","id":"电商场景下的复合键设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"路由层设计、SQL 解析与强制路由提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relational-database-sharding-distributed-scaling/sharding-strategy-routing-model/routing-layer-sql-parser-hint"}}